  "description": "Why is it called Pungsa (風邪)? Because it's like a cold that sticks to you no matter how much you try to shake it off. Does that mean only others will suffer? Your life will be harder. You'll have to walk a thorny path. It's okay. I'll live and laugh. I'll live with a smile. So don't worry. And so the entire martial arts world was struck by Pungsa. The exciting, arduous, and exhilarating adventures of the Pungsa gang that set the entire martial arts world ablaze!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
